</div>
  <p><b>start</b> &amp; <b>end</b> support <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Negative_Index" target="_blank">negative indexes</a>.</p>
  <p>Characters at positions <b>start</b> and <b>end</b> are removed.</p>
  <h2>Specification</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Index</th>
        <th>Positive</th>
        <th>Negative</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>First</td>
        <td>`0`</td>
        <td>`-length`</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Last</td>
        <td>`length - 1`</td>
        <td>`-1`</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h3>Indexes</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Positive indexes count from the beginning, the first item being indexed as `0`, the last as `(length - 1)`.</li>
  </ul>
  <ul>
    <li>Negative indexes count from the far end, the first item being indexed as `-length`, the last as `-1`.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If either <b>start</b> or <b>end</b> are out of bounds the script continues to execute without an error message.</li>
    <li><b>start</b> &amp; <b>end</b> will form an <a href="#exclusion_range" target="_blank">exclusion range</a> when <b>start</b> is past <b>end</b> (Approximately: <b>start</b> &gt; <b>end</b>).</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local function main()
    local ex = "abcdefghi"
    ll.DeleteSubString(ex, 4, 7)  --Incorrect!
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        string ex = "abcdefghi";
        llDeleteSubString(ex, 4, 7); //Incorrect!
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local function main()
    local ex = "abcdefghi"
    ex = ll.DeleteSubString(ex, 4, 7)  --Correct
    ll.Say(0, ex)  --Would say "abcdi"
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        string ex = "abcdefghi";
        ex = llDeleteSubString(ex, 4, 7); //Correct
        llSay(0, ex); //Would say "abcdi"
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

---- special case
local function main()
    local ex = "abcdefghi"
    ll.Say(0, ll.DeleteSubString(ex, 4, 7))  --Would say "abcdi"
---- acceptable if you do NOT want to change the contents of 'ex', only the output
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`//-- special case
